{"ticker":{"symbol":"226330.KQ","name":"신테카바이오","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":939.0,"change_pct":-0.053427419354838745,"market_cap":22778707968.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":5900.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Health Information Services","country":"South Korea","city":"Daejeon","employees":45,"website":"https://www.syntekabio.com","business_summary":"SyntekaBio, Inc. operates as an artificial intelligence new drug development company based on genomic big data primarily in South Korea. It derives new drug candidates using DeepMatcher, an AI drug development platform that combines new drug development technology and genomic big data technology. The company also researches and develops biomarker detection for individual cancer drug screening, disease susceptibility, immune typing, pharmacogenomic typing, and multi-omics information-based drug side effect prediction technology. The company was founded in 2009 and is headquartered in Daejeon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"신테카바이오(주)는 주로 한국에서 유전체 빅데이터 기반의 인공지능 신약개발 기업으로 활동하고 있습니다. 신약개발 기술과 유전체 빅데이터 기술을 결합한 AI 신약개발 플랫폼인 딥매처(DeepMatcher)를 이용해 신약후보물질을 도출한다. 또한, 개인별 항암제 스크리닝을 위한 바이오마커 검출, 질병감수성, 면역형, 약물유전체형, 다중오믹스 정보 기반 약물부작용 예측 기술을 연구개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2009년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 대전에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"건강 정보 서비스","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":243991560.0,"operating_income":-11792093440.0,"net_income":-4506425720.0,"eps":-333.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":123405800.0,"operating_income":-12276298200.0,"net_income":-11397644740.0,"eps":-796.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":120887130.0,"operating_income":-14271039870.0,"net_income":-7213184090.0,"eps":-790.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":3429231730.0,"operating_income":-10764609270.0,"net_income":-17378023880.0,"ep